                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="kaspatx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="We are convinced that the exchanges with healthcare professionals and healthcare organisations bring added value to patient care"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                type="h3"
                                variant="h"/>
                            <text_copy_copy_copy_
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2022-11-07T18:20:48.523-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-09T22:23:10.634-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>AbbVie works with healthcare professionals, healthcare organisations and patient organisations to improve the health of patients worldwide.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Our exchanges with healthcare professionals, healthcare organisations and patient organisations are characterised by openness and transparency in order to build public trust and create reliability. AbbVie discloses these business relationships to demonstrate its integrity in its collaboration with healthcare professionals, healthcare organisations and patient organisations.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>The exchanges with healthcare professionals, healthcare organisations and patient organisations leads to new and better therapies and, above all, better patient care. We believe that engaging with healthcare professionals and healthcare organisations is essential to advancing patient care, identifying gaps in medical care and driving forward the development of new medicines. Cooperation is based on trust, transparency and integrity.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Our aim is to give the public an insight into these interactions in order to strengthen trust and demonstrate reliability. AbbVie engages in various activities, from clinical research to sponsorship and educational activities, to share information on how new medicinal products can be integrated into the treatment pathway. By being transparent about these relationships, AbbVie emphasises its ongoing commitment and strengthens the foundation for future collaborations.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
