                            jcr:title="Disclosure of business relationships with healthcare professionals and healthcare organisations in Switzerland"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                            type="h3"
                            variant="h"/>
                        <accordion
                            cq:styleIds="[1]"
                            jcr:created="{Date}2024-05-09T22:27:25.973-04:00"
                            jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-08-02T14:24:45.792-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/accordion/v2/accordion"
                            singleExpansion="false">
                            <item_1715308068169
                                cq:panelTitle="Transfers of value  to doctors and organisations"
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-09T22:28:58.185-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>For its research into innovative medicinal products, AbbVie relies on the knowledge and experience of medical professionals. We can only collect important information for the research and development of innovative medicinal products, as well as expand our knowledge on their use, by collaborating with them. This helps us to improve patient care. We are convinced that the effects of a product go beyond the medicinal product per se. For this reason, the patients are the focus of all our activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <item_1715308077123
                                cq:panelTitle="Cooperation according to clear rules"
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-09T22:29:28.060-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>Cooperation with medical professionals and organisations follows clearly defined rules. If partners conduct studies on the efficacy and safety of new medicinal products for AbbVie Switzerland, they receive financial compensation. The participation of doctors in congresses for scientific exchange and further training on the safe use of medicinal products is also part of the cooperation.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa; &lt;br>&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <item_1715308084839
                                cq:panelTitle="Disclosure of benefits"
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-09T22:30:06.350-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>Transfers of value to medical professionals and organisations must be transparent to the public. For this reason, we disclose the transfers of value granted by AbbVie Switzerland retrospectively for the previous year. Pecuniary benefits are recorded for the following areas:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Donations&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Sponsoring and other financial support&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Invitations to training events&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Travel expenses in connection with the aforementioned activities&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Service and consulting fees&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <item_1715308092955
                                cq:panelTitle="Overview of services"
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-06-25T15:33:33.951-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="VALENSX5"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                langAttribute="none"
                                text="&lt;p>&lt;b>Pharma Code:&lt;/b> Code of Conduct of the Pharmaceutical Industry in Switzerland of 4 December 2003, revised on 22 May 2025.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Pharma Cooperation Code:&lt;/b> Code of Conduct of the Pharmaceutical Industry in Switzerland on Cooperation with Healthcare Professionals and Patient Organisations of 6 September 2013, revised on 22 May 2025.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>You can find an overview of the services here:&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/disclosures/switzerland/2023-abbvie-switzerland-efpia-report.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure of pecuniary benefits to healthcare professionals and healthcare organisations 2023&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/disclosures/switzerland/2024-abbvie-switzerland-efpia-report.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure of pecuniary benefits to healthcare professionals and healthcare organisations 2024&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/disclosures/switzerland/2025-abbvie-switzerland-efpia-report.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure of pecuniary benefits to healthcare professionals and healthcare organisations 2025&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/disclosures/switzerland/2023-abbvie-switzerland-supporting-document.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Methodological notes 2023&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/disclosures/switzerland/2024-abbvie-switzerland-supporting-document.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Methodological notes 2024&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/disclosures/switzerland/2025-abbvie-switzerland-supporting-document.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Methodological notes 2025&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                        </accordion>
                    </copy_of_container_co>
                    <container_copy_27180
