                        <title_copy
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1661545829678]"
                            jcr:created="{Date}2022-11-07T18:49:15.140-05:00"
                            jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-09T22:36:56.911-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            jcr:title="Business relationships with Swiss patient organisations"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                            type="h4"
                            variant="h"/>
                        <text_copy_copy_copy
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:created="{Date}2022-11-07T18:20:48.523-05:00"
                            jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-09T22:37:16.227-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>AbbVie is committed to making a real difference in the lives of patients and their families. We combine cutting-edge science with a deep understanding of patients' experiences and healthcare systems to help people live better lives. We want to learn more about the experiences of patients in order to understand the problems, concerns and priorities of people affected by a disease.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Patient organisations are a valuable source of information and support for patients and their families. We foster relationships with patient organisations based on mutual trust, respect and shared goals that meet AbbVie's standards of conduct in the areas of transparency and ethics. Through these relationships, AbbVie helps to inform patients and their families about disease patterns and ways to improve quality of life. These partnerships promote dialogue between interest groups and contribute towards the creation of new, cost-effective care models.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>AbbVie publishes an annual list of financially supported Swiss patient organisations. The publication of the following reports illustrates our commitment to transparent disclosure of our financial relationships with patient organisations.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                        <separator
