                            langAttribute="none"
                            text="&lt;p>Pharma Code: Code of Conduct of the Pharmaceutical Industry in Switzerland of 4 December 2003, revised on 22 May 2025.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Pharma Cooperation Code: Code of Conduct of the Pharmaceutical Industry in Switzerland on Cooperation with Healthcare Professionals and Patient Organisations of 6 September 2013, revised on 22 May 2025.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.ch/content/dam/abbvie-dotcom/ch/documents/FinancialSupport2023.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>FinancialSupport2023.pdf&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/ch/documents/FinancialSupport2024.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>FinancialSupport2024.pdf&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/ch/documents/financial-support-2025.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>FinancialSupport2025pdf&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
